ion as part of the Guards Armoured Division in Operation Overlord and Operation Market Garden. The 3rd Battalion fought in the North African Campaign, the Tunisia Campaign and lastly in the Italian campaigns of 1943.","LocalizedString":"The Welsh Guards are a part of the Guards Division and one of the Foot Guards Regiment of the British Army. The regiment grew from 1 to 3 battalions during WWII and throughout the war they served in various theaters. The 1st Battalion fought in numerous campaigns in Western Europe, first as part of the British Expeditionary Force in Belgium and France, and later with 2nd Battalion as part of the Guards Armoured Division in Operation Overlord and Operation Market Garden. The 3rd Battalion fought in the North African Campaign, the Tunisia Campaign and lastly in the Italian campaigns of 1943."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment","EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard"],"hasDeployment":true,"hasGuard":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/Allegiance/t_brits.t_brits","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Rebellion","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/WELSH_GUARDS.WELSH_GUARDS","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":387.0},"historyPhotoSource":"Imperial War Museums","historyPhotoIdentificationCode":"F 2548","historyPhotoAuthor":"Puttnam L A (Lt), War Office official photographer","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_welsh_guards_photo","SourceString":"1st Battalion of the Welsh Guards in Arras, France, 1940.","LocalizedString":"1st Battalion of the Welsh Guards in Arras, France, 1940."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_w